"mbin\">+ </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></p>\n<p>Now, using <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2 </span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">1 </span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, substitute into Equation 1 to solve for <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">x<sub>1</sub></span><sub><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></sub></span>:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1 </span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mclose\">) </span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span><br />\n<span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1 </span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">5 </span><span class=\"mbin\">+ </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mbin\">− </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span><br />\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"> <span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+ </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><sub><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​ </span></span></span></span></sub></span><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>Thus, we can express the solution as:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-43092\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GQsZfZzk/77033764e1f3.jpg\" alt=\"- Hamro CSIT\" width=\"131\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<p>where <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">x</span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><sub><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></sub><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is a free variable. This represents the set of all <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">x</span></span> in <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">R<sup>3</sup></span></span> that satisfy <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">T(x) </span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mrel\">= </span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>.</p>\n"
